      "markdown": "If you're looking for **smart lock installation in Port Melbourne**, here are some reputable local options:\n\n1. Port Melbourne Locksmiths – Based in Port Melbourne, they install and service smart locks, electronic locks, and access control systems. They have strong customer ratings and operate 24/7. Their website also highlights smart lock installation services. [www.corplock.com.au](https://www.corplock.com.au/pages/locksmith-port-melbourne?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n2. Graham Bay Locksmith – A local Bay Street locksmith offering residential and commercial locksmith services. It's worth contacting them to confirm support for your preferred smart lock brand.\n\n3. Precision Locksmiths Melbourne – Located nearby in Spotswood, they provide smart lock installation and emergency locksmith services.\n\n4. SMART LOCK INSTALLATION – A Melbourne-wide specialist focused on smart locks. They service Port Melbourne and can advise on door compatibility before installation. [smartlocksmelbourne.au](https://smartlocksmelbourne.au/pages/service-areas-smart-lock-installation?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nBefore booking, it's helpful to ask:\n- Whether they install the specific brand you've chosen (e.g. Lockly, Yale, Aqara, Schlage, Lockwood, Samsung).\n- Whether your door is compatible (timber, aluminium, steel, fire-rated apartment door, etc.).\n- Whether they'll set up the app, fingerprints, PIN codes, and Wi-Fi/Bluetooth connection.\n- The total installed price, including any door modifications if required.\n\nIf you haven't bought a lock yet, let me know:\n- whether it's for a **house, apartment, or office**,\n- your **door material** (timber, aluminium, or steel), and\n- whether you want **fingerprint, keypad, Apple Home Key, Google Home, or remote access**,\n\nand I can recommend the best smart lock for your setup and budget.",
